vocation — no candidate proposed yet for that gap specifically.

3. LARGELY RESOLVED 2026-07-21 — WHAT CITY / DISTRICT / FACTION IS THIS RELIGION'S HOME, IF ANY?
Reframed: rather than one shared home city (like Ice-Cold Buddhism's Kunlun/Dome Fuji), different
denominations have different natural strongholds. Confirmed 2026-07-21 (see Draft_Sheet.md's "Connection to
Gameplay/Factions" for full detail): Watchers → Kunlun; the Enfolded → Scott, Mawson, Esperanza; the Bound →
Byrd, Belgrano; the Cyclical → Signy, Princess Elisabeth; the Already-Complete → Concordia's "Ossuary Quarter"
district. **Still genuinely open: a second stronghold candidate for the Already-Complete** (only one proposed
so far) — otherwise this question is effectively answered pending final developer sign-off on each pairing.

